{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's On-The-Job Training"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Steep Learning Curve"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le17ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Past Tense versus Past Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about an event or action that was happening at a time in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u2013ied</span>.<br/> Irregular verbs change in different ways. (e.g. <span class=\"italic\">have &#8594; had, eat &#8594; ate</span>)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "For the Past Continuous tense, you write <span class=\"italic\">was/were</span> + verb + <span class=\"italic\">ing</span>.<br/> Some verbs need a change to the last letter before you add <span class=\"italic\">. (e.g. <span class=\"italic\">run &#8594; running</span>, <span class=\"italic\">make &#8594; making</span>)"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talked \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were talking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" get \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"got \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were getting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" fly \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"flew\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were flying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" work \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worked \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were working\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" discuss \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"discussed \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were discussing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enjoy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enjoyed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were enjoying\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">was thinking</span> about doing an article on types of ice cream. (<span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span>)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "My editor <span class=\"strong\">told</span> me that wasn't a good idea. (<span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span>)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">was considering</span> a story about people's favorite ice cream. (<span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span>)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Then I <span class=\"strong\">remembered</span> they asked me to write about different jobs.(<span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span>)"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nerve-wracking "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "difficult; stressful "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My first day on the job was a bit nerve-wracking."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "learning curve"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the amount of things you need to learn, described like on a graph going up "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll have a steep learning curve, that's for sure."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "editor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person responsible for deciding on the content of publications like newspapers or magazines"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: My editor told me it wasn't a good idea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lawyer "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who defends people in the legal system, or tries to prove they are guilty of a crime"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Working as a lawyer is difficult."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dentist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who cares for teeth. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It makes many years of education to become a dentist."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "secretary "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who assists with a variety of office tasks "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Secretaries are very important in an organization."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "physician "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "medical doctor"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "exa